  numpy           BSD-3-Clause          (extras: tracking, supervision)
  onnx            Apache-2.0            (extra: deploy)
  onnxruntime     MIT                   (extra: deploy)
  tensorboard     Apache-2.0            (extra: tensorboard)
  TensorRT        NVIDIA proprietary    (extra: tensorrt)
